:: Deadwood Love Locket Reactions [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-robin-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Robin leans closer when you open the locket. "What did you want to show me?"
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"Still me?" <<He>> recognises the picture and looks up with a smile.<<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>"Oh. That's me." <<He>> lets out a small breath, looking between you and the picture.<<else>>"Me?" <<His>> cheeks colour. "I didn't know you had that one."<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>"You take it with you when you go out?" <<He>> sounds pleased by the thought.<<elseif _locket_selected>><<He>> starts to ask something, then smiles at you instead.<<else>>"It's nice that you kept it." <<He>> looks a little shy as <<he>> says it.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            "Nothing inside?" <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>Robin purses <<his>> lips. "I was wondering if you might..." <<He>> glances up at you. "Never mind."<<else>><<He>> looks at the little frame. "Do you just like the necklace? It suits you."<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Eden' and $edenSeen?.includes('robinGutPunch')>>Robin's expression tightens. <<He>> rubs <<his>> arm. "I remember." <<He>> looks at you rather than the photograph.<<elseif _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>"Oh." Robin looks at the picture again. "Have you been seeing a lot of each other?"<<else>>"Someone you know?" Robin looks interested. "Does it have a story?"<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You tell Robin you like carrying <<his>> photograph. "I like that too." <<He>> smiles down at it, then at you. <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 40>>"You can look at me while I'm here, though."<<else>>"I didn't think you'd want to take me everywhere." <<He>> laughs softly at <<himself>>.<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You tell Robin that you came to spend time with <<him>>. "Okay." <<He>> takes a moment, then looks up. <<if _locket_formal>>"I was trying to work out what you wanted me to say."<<else>>"I'm glad you came."<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You close the locket. Robin glances at the clasp, then lifts <<his>> head when you ask about something else. "Oh, right."
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You explain that you like the necklace itself. "It's pretty even without a picture," Robin agrees.<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You tell Robin why you kept this picture. <<He>> listens with a small smile, growing redder as you go on. "I didn't know you remembered that."<<else>>You tell Robin what the photograph means to you. "Oh. I see." <<He>> listens to the rest, looking at your face as you speak.<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          你打开吊坠，罗宾凑近一些。“想给我看什么？”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“还是我？”<<He>>认出照片，笑着抬头看你。<<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>“哦。是我。”<<He>>轻轻呼出一口气，看看你，又看看照片。<<else>>“我？”<<His>>脸红起来。“我不知道你有这张。”<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>“出门的时候，你也带着它？”想到这里，<<he>>似乎很高兴。<<elseif _locket_selected>><<He>>刚想问什么，随后只是对你笑了笑。<<else>>“你还留着，真好。”<<He>>说这话时有些腼腆。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            “里面什么都没有？”<<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>罗宾抿了抿嘴。“我还在想，你会不会……”<<He>>抬眼看你。“没什么。”<<else>><<He>>看看小相框。“只是喜欢这条项链吗？很适合你。”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Eden' and $edenSeen?.includes('robinGutPunch')>>罗宾的表情绷紧了。<<He>>揉了揉胳膊。“我记得。”<<He>>望向你，没有再看照片。<<elseif _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>“哦。”罗宾又看了一眼照片。“你们最近经常见面吗？”<<else>>“认识的人？”罗宾有些好奇。“有什么故事吗？”<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你告诉罗宾，自己喜欢带着<<his>>照片。“我也喜欢这样。”<<He>>笑着低头看它，再抬眼看你。<<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 40>>“不过，我在这里的时候，可以看看我本人。”<<else>>“没想到，你会愿意去哪里都带着我。”<<He>>说完，自己轻轻笑起来。<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你告诉罗宾，今天是来陪<<him>>的。“好。”<<He>>停了一下，才抬起头。<<if _locket_formal>>“我刚才一直在想，你想听我说什么。”<<else>>“你能过来，我很高兴。”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你合上吊坠。罗宾瞥了眼扣件，听见你问起别的事，又抬起头。“哦，对了。”
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你解释，自己喜欢的是项链本身。“不放照片也很好看。”罗宾赞同道。<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你告诉罗宾，为什么留下这张照片。<<He>>带着一点笑听你说，脸却越来越红。“我不知道你还记着。”<<else>>你告诉罗宾，这张照片对自己意味着什么。“哦。这样啊。”<<He>>继续听着，目光停在说话的你脸上。<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-whitney-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Whitney looks down at the locket you hold open. "What, showing off your jewellery now?"
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"Still got that?" <<His>> grin widens. "Fucking fan club."<<else>><<He>> recognises <<himself>> and laughs. "Got yourself some merchandise?"<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>"You're such a dork." <<He>> sounds pleased with <<himself>>.<<elseif _locket_selected>>"So that's why you keep finding me." <<He>> tilts <<his>> head at you.<<else>>"Didn't know I was that famous." <<He>> looks up to watch your reaction.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            "All that fuss, and there's fuck all in it." <<if _locket_selected>><<He>> smirks. "What, expecting an autograph?"<<else>><<He>> flicks a glance at your face. "You're easily entertained."<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Kylar'>>"That freak?" Whitney wrinkles <<his>> nose. "You really know how to ruin a nice necklace."<<elseif _locket_photo is 'Sydney'>>"The teacher's pet?" <<He>> lets out a short laugh. "Figures."<<else>>"Who's that supposed to be?" <<He>> looks more amused than impressed.<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>"And here you are bothering me." <<He>> looks from the picture to you.<<else>>"Go on, then. What's so interesting?"<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You say you like taking <<his>> photograph with you. "Yeah? Try looking at the actual person." <<He>> catches your eye and holds it, grinning. "Better, isn't it?"
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You tell Whitney that you came to see <<him>> today. "Took you long enough to get to the point." <<if _locket_formal>><<He>> shifts closer, leaving your hand on the locket.<<else>><<He>> raises an eyebrow. "Well? I'm here."<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You snap the locket shut. "Done with the exhibition?" Whitney scoffs, then looks back at you. "What now?"
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You say you like the necklace without a photograph. "Paid for an empty box. Nice one." <<He>> gives a low chuckle.<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You tell <<him>> why you picked the photograph. "You rehearsed that?" <<He>> laughs, but listens to the rest.<<else>>You explain what the picture means to you. "Didn't ask for a fucking biography." <<He>> folds <<his>> arms, though <<he>> keeps listening.<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          惠特尼低头看向你托着的吊坠。“怎么，还炫耀起首饰来了？”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“还留着？”<<His>>笑容更明显了。“真他妈是个粉丝。”<<else>><<He>>认出自己，笑出声。“给自己弄了件周边？”<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>“傻得要命。”<<He>>听起来却相当得意。<<elseif _locket_selected>>“难怪总来找我。”<<He>>歪头看你。<<else>>“都不知道我这么有名了。”<<He>>抬眼，盯着你的反应。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            “折腾半天，里面屁都没有。”<<if _locket_selected>><<He>>坏笑起来。“怎么，等着要签名？”<<else>><<He>>瞥了眼你的脸。“你还真容易满足。”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Kylar'>>“那个怪胎？”惠特尼皱了皱鼻子。“好好一条项链，倒让你糟蹋了。”<<elseif _locket_photo is 'Sydney'>>“老师的乖宝宝？”<<He>>短促地笑了一声。“也难怪。”<<else>>“这又是谁？”<<He>>看起来觉得好笑，没什么佩服的意思。<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>“结果，还跑来烦我。”<<He>>看看照片，再看看你。<<else>>“说吧，有什么稀奇的？”<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你说，自己喜欢把<<his>>照片带在身边。“是吗？试试看看真人。”<<He>>迎上你的视线，咧嘴笑着，没先移开目光。“更好看吧？”
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你告诉惠特尼，今天是来见<<him>>的。“可算说到重点了。”<<if _locket_formal>><<He>>挪近一些，你的手仍放在吊坠上。<<else>><<He>>扬起眉毛。“然后呢？我就在这儿。”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你啪地合上吊坠。“展览结束了？”惠特尼嗤了一声，重新看向你。“接下来干什么？”
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你说，里面不放照片，自己也喜欢这条项链。“花钱买个空盒子。真有你的。”<<He>>低低笑了几声。<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你告诉<<him>>，为什么挑选这张照片。“还排练过？”<<He>>笑着，倒是听你说完了。<<else>>你解释照片对自己的意义。“我他妈又没让你讲人物传记。”<<He>>抱起胳膊，却还在听。<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-avery-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Avery follows the movement of your hand as you open the locket. "Let's see, then."
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"Ah, that one again." <<He>> studies it with evident satisfaction.<<else>>"My, my. How flattering." <<He>> looks from the picture to you.<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>"You thought I'd appreciate seeing it? You were right."<<else>>"An interesting choice." <<He>> smiles, waiting for you to say more.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            "An empty frame." <<if _locket_selected>>Avery lifts an eyebrow. "Were you hoping for a suggestion?"<<else>><<He>> looks over the little case. "An ornament, then. It does suit you."<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Robin' and $robinaverybeat is 1>>Avery's smile vanishes. "I haven't forgotten what that brat did."<<elseif _locket_photo is 'Whitney' and $averySeen?.includes('whitney_crash')>>"The one who took my car." <<His>> voice goes flat. "How charming."<<elseif _locket_selected>>"Someone else?" <<He>> examines your face. "I admit, I expected a different picture."<<else>>"An acquaintance of yours?" <<He>> gives the photograph a measured glance.<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You explain that you like carrying <<his>> photograph. "How sweet, <<pcpetname 'Avery'>>." <<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>><<His>> smile is brief. "It's pleasant to hear you say so."<<else>><<He>> looks at the photograph once more, plainly enjoying the attention. "You do know how to flatter me."<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You say that you came to spend time with Avery. "Then do look at me while we're talking." <<He>> waits for your eyes to meet <<his>>. <<if _locket_formal>>"There. Much better."<<else>>"Now, what did you have in mind?"<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You close the locket and bring up something else. Avery watches the clasp shut. "Very well." <<His>> attention returns to your face. "Go on."
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You explain that you chose it for the necklace itself. "You liked the design." Avery gives the little case another glance. "I can appreciate that."<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You explain why you chose that picture. "You noticed that?" <<He>> smiles at the detail, looking rather pleased.<<else>>You tell Avery what you wanted to remember. "So that's why you kept it." <<He>> lets the words linger before returning <<his>> gaze to you.<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          你打开吊坠，艾弗里的目光跟着你的手移动。“那么，让我看看。”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“啊，还是那张。”<<He>>端详着，显然很满意。<<else>>“哎呀，真让人受宠若惊。”<<He>>看看照片，又看看你。<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>“想着我会喜欢看？你猜对了。”<<else>>“有意思的选择。”<<He>>微笑着，等你继续说。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            “空相框。”<<if _locket_selected>>艾弗里挑起眉毛。“想听听我的建议？”<<else>><<He>>打量了一遍小盒子。“当作首饰。倒也适合你。”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Robin' and $robinaverybeat is 1>>艾弗里的笑容消失了。“那个小鬼做过什么，我可没忘。”<<elseif _locket_photo is 'Whitney' and $averySeen?.includes('whitney_crash')>>“开走我车的那个。”<<His>>声音平下来。“真讨人喜欢。”<<elseif _locket_selected>>“别人？”<<He>>仔细看着你的表情。“说实话，我以为会是另一张照片。”<<else>>“你的熟人？”<<He>>不动声色地看了眼照片。<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你解释，自己喜欢带着<<his>>照片。“真贴心，<<pcpetname 'Avery'>>。”<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>><<His>>笑容一闪即逝。“很高兴听见你这样说。”<<else>><<He>>又看了一次照片，显然很享受你的关注。“你确实知道怎么讨我开心。”<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你说，自己今天是来陪艾弗里的。“那么，说话的时候，看着我。”<<He>>等你的目光与<<his>>相遇。<<if _locket_formal>>“这样就好多了。”<<else>>“现在，说说你想做些什么？”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你合上吊坠，说起别的事。艾弗里看着搭扣合拢。“好吧。”<<His>>注意力重新回到你的脸上。“继续说。”
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你解释，自己买它是因为喜欢这条项链。“看中了样式。”艾弗里又看了眼小盒子。“这我倒能理解。”<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你解释为什么选这张照片。“你注意到了？”<<He>>听见那个细节，露出颇为满意的笑。<<else>>你告诉艾弗里，自己想记住什么。“原来，你是为这个才留着。”<<He>>顿了片刻，才又望向你。<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-alex-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Alex bends to look when you turn the open locket towards <<him>>. "What's that you've got?"
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"Still hauling me about?" <<He>> laughs, looking at the picture again.<<else>>"That's me." <<He>> blinks, then grins. "Looking a bit more respectable than usual."<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>"You take it into town as well?" <<He>> tries to make it sound casual.<<else>>"You kept that one?" <<His>> smile grows a little sheepish.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            "Haven't picked one yet?" <<if _locket_selected>>Alex looks up at you. "Got someone in mind?" <<His>> ears colour as <<he>> asks.<<else>><<He>> looks at the small frame. "Can't get much of a photograph in there, can you?"<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy' and $farm_stage gte 7>>Alex's jaw tightens. "That bastard? What's <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> doing in there?"<<elseif _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>"Oh, right." <<His>> grin fades a little. "What's the story behind that one?"<<else>>"Who's that?" <<He>> looks at the picture, then at you. "Someone you've met on your travels?"<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You tell Alex you like carrying <<his>> photograph when you're away. "Good company, am I?" <<if C.npc.Alex.dom gte 30>><<He>> gives you a pleased grin. "Can't say I'm surprised."<<else>><<He>> starts to grin, then looks down when you catch <<him>> at it. "That's nice. Really nice."<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You tell Alex you came to spend time with <<him>> today. <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy' and $farm_stage gte 7>>"I still don't like seeing <<nnpc_him 'Remy'>> in there." Alex looks back at you. "But I'm glad you came."<<else>>"Good." <<He>> looks at the picture once more, then up at you. "Could use the company."<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You close the locket and settle it back against your chest. Alex rubs the back of <<his>> neck. "All right. What were you going to say?"
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You explain that you like it as a necklace. "Doesn't need a picture to look nice," Alex agrees. "Just keep the catch clean. Mud gets into everything."<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You tell Alex why you picked the picture. <<He>> makes a joke about the horse looking better than <<him>>, then goes quiet and red-faced while you finish.<<else>>You tell Alex what you wanted to remember. <<He>> listens, rubbing a thumb over <<his>> palm. "So it's important to you."<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          你把敞开的吊坠转向艾利克斯，<<he>>俯身来看。“拿着什么呢？”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“还带着我到处跑？”<<He>>笑了，又看一遍照片。<<else>>“这是我。”<<He>>眨了眨眼，随后咧嘴笑起来。“比平时体面一些。”<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>“去镇上也带着？”<<He>>想让自己听起来随意些。<<else>>“你还留着这张？”<<His>>笑容里多了点不好意思。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            “还没挑好？”<<if _locket_selected>>艾利克斯抬头看你。“想好要放谁了吗？”问出这句话时，<<his>>耳朵红了。<<else>><<He>>看看小相框。“这么点地方，能放下多大的照片？”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy' and $farm_stage gte 7>>艾利克斯绷紧了下巴。“那个混蛋？怎么把<<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>放进去了？”<<elseif _locket_selected and _locket_formal>>“哦，这样。”<<His>>笑容淡了些。“这张有什么故事？”<<else>>“这是谁？”<<He>>看看照片，又看看你。“在外头认识的人？”<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你告诉艾利克斯，不在农场的时候，也喜欢把<<his>>照片带在身边。“有我陪着挺好，是吧？”<<if C.npc.Alex.dom gte 30>><<He>>得意地咧嘴笑着。“倒也不意外。”<<else>><<He>>刚想咧嘴笑，被你看见，又低下头。“真好。真的。”<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你告诉艾利克斯，今天是来陪<<him>>的。<<if _locket_photo is 'Remy' and $farm_stage gte 7>>“我还是不喜欢看<<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>待在里面。”艾利克斯重新望向你。“不过，你能过来，我很高兴。”<<else>>“那就好。”<<He>>又看了一眼照片，再抬头看你。“正想找人陪陪。”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你合上吊坠，让它重新贴在胸前。艾利克斯揉了揉后颈。“好吧。刚才想说什么？”
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你解释，自己喜欢把它当作项链。“不用放照片，也挺好看。”艾利克斯赞同道。“扣件要擦干净。泥可是哪儿都钻。”<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你告诉艾利克斯，为什么挑选这张照片。<<He>>开玩笑说，马照得比自己好看，随后红着脸安静下来，听你把话说完。<<else>>你告诉艾利克斯，自己想记住什么。<<He>>听着，拇指擦过掌心。“所以，对你挺要紧。”<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-gwylan-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Gwylan bends towards the open locket. "Oh, what have we here, dear?"
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"That old face again." <<He>> looks up, smiling. "You haven't tired of it yet?"<<else>>"For little old me?" <<He>> looks again to make sure, then laughs softly.<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>"You do know how to make an old soul smile." <<His>> cheeks colour despite the light tone.<<else>>"I didn't know you had a photograph of me." <<He>> looks at you with renewed curiosity.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            "Still waiting for a picture?" <<if _locket_selected>><<He>> tilts <<his>> head. "Was there someone you wanted to ask about, dear?"<<else>><<He>> studies the border. "Such a little frame. Worth taking your time over."<</if>>
          <<else>>
            "Who have you brought along?" <<He>> looks at the picture without touching it. <<if _locket_selected>>Gwylan pauses, then returns <<his>> gaze to you. "Someone you'd like to tell me about?"<<else>>"A keepsake from your travels, dear?"<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You tell Gwylan you like having <<his>> photograph close. "You must have a great deal of patience with that old face." <<He>> chuckles, smooths <<his>> hair, then catches <<himself>> doing it. "You've quite flustered me, dear."
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You say that you came to spend time with Gwylan today. "And here I am, asking about everybody else." <<He>> smiles at you. <<if _locket_formal>>"What shall we talk about, dear?"<<else>>"Tell me how you've been."<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You close the little case. Gwylan straightens with a soft laugh. "Very well, dear. What else did you have on your mind?"
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You explain that you like the necklace itself. "A pretty little container can be reason enough," <<he>> agrees, looking at its border.<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You explain why you kept that photograph. Gwylan listens with <<his>> head tilted, then smiles. "I hadn't thought of it that way."<<else>>You tell <<him>> what the picture means to you. "Something worth keeping safe, then." <<He>> looks at the catch. "Don't let that little clasp work loose."<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          格威岚俯身看向打开的吊坠。“哎呀，这是什么，亲爱的？”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“又是这张老面孔。”<<He>>笑着抬起头。“还没看腻吗？”<<else>>“特地留给我这把老骨头的？”<<He>>又看了一遍，确认没看错，才轻轻笑起来。<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>“你真知道怎么逗老人家开心。”<<His>>语气轻快，脸颊却红了。<<else>>“不知道，你还有我的照片。”<<He>>带着新添的好奇望向你。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            “还在等一张照片？”<<if _locket_selected>><<He>>偏了偏头。“想问问谁的事吗，亲爱的？”<<else>><<He>>端详着边饰。“这么小的相框，也值得慢慢挑。”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            “把谁一起带来了？”<<He>>看了看照片，没有去碰。<<if _locket_selected>>格威岚停了一下，才重新看向你。“想跟我说说这个人吗？”<<else>>“外出时留下的纪念，亲爱的？”<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你告诉格威岚，自己喜欢把<<his>>照片带在身边。“对这张老面孔，你倒是很有耐心。”<<He>>轻笑着，理了理头发，随后才发现自己在做什么。“倒让你弄得有些不好意思了，亲爱的。”
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你说，今天是来陪格威岚的。“我倒一直问着别人的事。”<<He>>向你微笑。<<if _locket_formal>>“那聊点什么，亲爱的？”<<else>>“说说，你最近怎么样？”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你合上小盒子。格威岚轻笑着直起身。“好吧，亲爱的。还有什么想说的吗？”
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你解释，自己喜欢的是项链本身。“一个漂亮的小盒子，就足够让人喜欢了。”<<He>>赞同道，又看了看边饰。<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你解释为什么留下这张照片。格威岚歪头听着，随后露出微笑。“之前倒没这样想过。”<<else>>你告诉<<him>>，这张照片对自己意味着什么。“那可得好好留着。”<<He>>看看扣件。“别让这小搭扣松了。”<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-tsukihan-text'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          Tsukihan turns towards you as you open the locket. "Something you wanted to show me?"
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>"Still that one." <<He>> recognises the picture before looking up at you.<<else>>"That's me." <<He>> looks again, then back at your face.<</if>>
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"I didn't know you carried it with you." <<He>> smooths the edge of <<his>> sleeve, then lets it go.<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Do I smile like that?" <<He>> tries to copy the expression and starts smiling again.<<else>>"A little more light." <<He>> tilts <<his>> head to see it. "There. Now let me look at you."<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>"I like knowing you take me along." <<He>> meets your eyes as <<he>> says it.<<elseif _locket_selected>>"Why did you choose that one?" <<He>> seems interested in more than how the photograph looks.<<else>>"Thank you for showing me." <<He>> leaves the little case in your palm.<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Do you prefer it like this?" <<He>> studies the empty frame.<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Still deciding what to keep inside?" <<He>> looks at the border, then at you.<<else>>"You brought me an empty frame to look at?" <<He>> raises an eyebrow, amused. "All right. Tell me what you like about it."<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>"Or was there something you wanted to ask me?"<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed and C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"Someone else." <<His>> mouth draws into a small pout. "And what did you want to tell me about them?"<<elseif _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>"Oh." <<He>> looks at the picture a little longer. "Someone you wanted me to know about?"<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"Your turn to do the talking, then." <<He>> looks from the photograph to you. "Who's this?"<<else>>"Who is that?" <<He>> leans closer to see, then looks up to hear your answer.<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          You tell Tsukihan you like having <<his>> photograph with you. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"I'm glad you told me." <<His>> fingers settle against <<his>> sleeve. "I like hearing it."<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Then I get to go a little further than the shops." <<He>> smiles at the thought, then back at you.<<else>>"Once more." The request comes at once. <<He>> smiles. "I'd like to hear it again."<</if>>
          <<if !$MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>"I've been wondering what you thought when you looked at it." <<He>> leaves the question there.<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          You say that you came to spend time with Tsukihan today. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Oh. Good." <<He>> looks up again, the crease between <<his>> brows easing.<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Then tell me about your day." <<He>> turns a little more towards you.<<else>>"Good. My turn for your attention." <<He>> catches your eye. "You can start with what you've been doing."<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          You close the locket. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"All right." <<He>> folds <<his>> hands and looks up when you begin another subject.<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Something else, then?" <<He>> turns back towards you, listening.<<else>>"Finished already?" <<He>> watches the clasp shut. "At least tell me something before changing the subject again."<</if>>
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>You explain that you like the necklace itself. "The little border is nicely made." Tsukihan looks at the catch. "A good clasp matters more than people think."<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>You tell Tsukihan why you chose that photograph. <<if _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>"You hadn't told me that part." <<He>> smiles down at it.<<else>>"I hadn't thought of it that way." <<He>> studies the photograph once more.<</if>><<else>>You explain what the picture means to you. Tsukihan listens, then asks when it was taken. Before long, <<he>> is asking about the day around it as well.<</if>>
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'intro'>>
          你打开吊坠，月羽转过身来。“有东西想给我看？”
          <<if _locket_photo is _locket_name>>
            <<if _locket_familiar>>“还是这张。”<<He>>认出照片，又抬眼看你。<<else>>“这是我。”<<He>>又看了一遍，才望回你的脸。<</if>>
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“没想到，你还随身带着。”<<He>>抚了抚袖边，又松开手。<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“笑得这么明显吗？”<<He>>想学照片里的表情，却又先笑了起来。<<else>>“往亮处一点。”<<He>>偏头看清楚。“好了。现在让我看看你。”<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected and _locket_formal and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>“你肯把我带在身边，我很高兴。”说这话时，<<he>>望着你的眼睛。<<elseif _locket_selected>>“怎么挑了这张？”<<He>>在意的，似乎不只是照片拍得好不好。<<else>>“谢谢你拿给我看。”<<He>>没有去拿，仍让小盒子留在你掌中。<</if>>
          <<elseif !_locket_photo>>
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“更喜欢空着吗？”<<He>>端详着小相框。<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“还在想，里面该留什么？”<<He>>看看边饰，再看看你。<<else>>“特意拿个空相框给我看？”<<He>>挑起眉毛，有些好笑。“好吧。说说，喜欢它哪里？”<</if>>
            <<if _locket_selected>>“还是，有什么想问我的？”<</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed and C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“是别人。”<<His>>嘴微微噘起来。“那想跟我说说，这个人怎么了？”<<elseif _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>“哦。”<<He>>多看了一会儿照片。“想让我认识的人吗？”<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“那这回，轮到你讲了。”<<He>>看看照片，又看看你。“这是谁？”<<else>>“这是谁？”<<He>>凑近看了看，再抬起头，等你回答。<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'affection'>>
          你告诉月羽，自己喜欢带着<<his>>照片。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“听你这么说，我很高兴。”<<His>>手指停在袖边。“我喜欢听你讲。”<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“那我也能跟着你出趟远门了。”想到这里，<<he>>笑了，又望向你。<<else>>“再说一次。”话立刻出了口。<<He>>笑起来。“想再听一次。”<</if>>
          <<if !$MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>“一直有点好奇，你看着它时，在想什么。”<<He>>说完，没有再接着问。<</if>>
        <<case 'reassure'>>
          你说，今天是来陪月羽的。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“哦。那就好。”<<He>>又抬起眼，眉间的褶子松开了些。<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“那说说，今天过得怎么样？”<<He>>又往你这边转过一点。<<else>>“好。也该轮到我了。”<<He>>迎上你的视线。“先说说，你今天都做什么了。”<</if>>
        <<case 'private'>>
          你合上吊坠。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“好。”<<He>>拢好双手，听见你说起别的事，又抬起头。<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“那聊点别的？”<<He>>转回你这边，听你往下说。<<else>>“就看完了？”<<He>>看着搭扣合上。“这回，总得说点什么，再换下一个话题吧。”<</if>>
        <<case 'explain'>>
          <<if !_locket_photo>>你解释，自己喜欢的是项链本身。“这圈边饰，做得挺细。”月羽看了看扣件。“搭扣好不好，其实也很要紧。”<<elseif _locket_photo is _locket_name>>你告诉月羽，为什么挑了这张照片。<<if _locket_selected and $MoreTransformations.shrine.confessed>>“这一点，之前没跟我说过。”<<He>>笑着低头看它。<<else>>“之前，倒没这样想过。”<<He>>又端详了一次照片。<</if>><<else>>你解释这张照片对自己的意义。月羽听完，问起是什么时候拍的。聊着聊着，连那天别的事，也跟着问起来了。<</if>>
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>
